# NECK TRAINING

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

Neck Training consists of structured exercises designed to improve cervical strength, endurance, stability and injury resilience.

Within CAS, it is considered a foundational component of combat athlete robustness and long-term performance.

---

# Philosophy

The head directs the body.

Control of the neck improves posture, striking stability, grappling efficiency and resistance to external forces.

CAS integrates neck training not only to improve performance, but also to enhance athlete durability.

